      "message": "Can you clarify what functional limitation exists with the current one-file-to-one-object model, and why fixing the trust-store indexing alone would not be sufficient?\n\nFrom my understanding, the issue appears to be related to how certificates within a bundle are indexed for trust-store lookup. Is there a functional requirement, user-visible limitation, or DMTF/Redfish recommendation that necessitates representing each certificate in the bundle as a separate Certificate object?",
